<title>USA: Webster Financial says OTS ok's purchase.</title>
<headline>Webster Financial says OTS ok's purchase.</headline>
<dateline>WATERBURY, Conn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Webster Financial Corp said the Office of Thrift Supervision granted it approval to complete its purchase of People's Savings Financial Corp, a holding company of People's Savings Bank &amp; Trust.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the People's shareholders approved the merger at a special meeting on Tuesday, July 30.</p>
